# Draft files (files or directories starting with __)
__*

# Third-party sources the build draws from rather than carries: cloned where a script needs them, and
# ignored because what is drawn from them is what is committed. See `cargo dev icons`.
/THIRD-PARTY/material-icons/

# Corpora are not carried: a format's own files are megabytes each, several per pattern, and a
# repository that carried one set per format would be a repository nobody clones. What is carried is
# the two small files inside each one that make it a record — `policy.toml` and `SCORE.md` — and
# `modules/chunking/corpus/.gitignore` is where that line is drawn. The synthetic chain set is
# generated here rather than there, so it is ignored whole. See `dev/chunker-harness/README.md`.
/modules/chunking/corpus/synthetic/
